# spec_tests.vec - black-box tests for bacapp derived from SPEC.md v1.0.
# Each block header lists the SPEC rule id(s) the block targets.
# Expected outputs were derived by hand from SPEC.md, bacapp.h and the driver.c
# output format; no implementation was consulted.  No printed byte string
# exceeds 64 bytes (long encodings are only checked through capacity errors).

